===Verb===
{{ar-verb (old)|I|قَمَرَ|qámara}}

# to [[gamble]]
# to [[defeat]] in gambling

{{ar-verb (old)|I|قَمِرَ|qámira}}

# to be [[snow-blind]]

{{ar-verb (old)|II|قمّر|qámmara}}

# to [[toast]] (bread)

{{ar-verb (old)|III|قَامَرَ|qāmara}}

# to [[gamble]] (with someone)
# to [[risk]] (something)
# to [[bet]] on, [[speculate]] on

{{ar-verb (old)|IV|اقْمَرَ|’áqmara}}

# to be [[moonlit]]

{{ar-verb (old)|VI|تَقَامَرَ|taqāmara}}

# to [[gamble]] with one another

